Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:15.62,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,My first time back home in a year!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.23,0:00:18.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Father, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:23.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I've completed my year of bridal \Ntraining and returned home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:25.36,Default,Iltiana,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:27.76,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to be home, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:32.53,Default,Iltiana,0,0,0,,You'll have to tell us all \Nabout Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:34.03,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:38.27,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I want to hear about all that's \Nhappened here in the past year, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:43.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I brought some delicious wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:46.28,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Shall we all enjoy it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.28,0:00:49.72,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Prince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:54.78,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,P-Pardon me, sir, \Nbut visitors have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:59.16,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Visitors? But I wasn't expecting anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:00.95,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:04.90,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,It's Prince Hartknights and Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:10.30,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What are those two doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:29.36,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:47.02,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\b1\pos(320,123)\c&HB36BF7&\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25}Blessings{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}on the {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Teary Bride{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.41,0:02:51.18,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Send them away at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:57.03,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Father, I want to speak with Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:02:58.78,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:02.33,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,What are you thinking, Lady Tiararose?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.90,0:03:05.48,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can't blame them all for being angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:09.97,Flashback Italics,Akari FB INT,0,0,0,,If you lose to the sequel's heroine, \NI'll never forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.78,0:03:13.83,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Just Lady Akari alone will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:15.17,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:18.18,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:22.18,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,I wish I knew who you got \Nyour stubbornness from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:23.93,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,I will allow it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:28.10,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,but only under the condition that \NPrince Aquasteed accompanies you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:29.97,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Well, then, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.97,0:03:32.61,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being so demanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:37.66,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Not at all. \NI love listening to your demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:41.12,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Oh, Lady Tiara! Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:44.51,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Oh, and Prince Aqua is here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:48.79,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,It's nice to see you again. \NI'm so glad you seem well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:50.86,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes, it's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:52.29,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:55.48,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you're \Ndoing well, Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.48,0:03:59.69,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm working hard \Nwith Prince Hartknights!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:06.06,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Since we're long past the ending, \NI feel like I'm playing the next new game!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.06,0:04:08.48,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Sh-She hasn't changed, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:11.17,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Oops! How silly of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.63,0:04:16.46,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Lady Tiara, Prince Aqua, allow me \Nto congratulate you on your marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:18.99,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:19.95,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:23.81,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:28.05,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,Well done winning out \Nover the sequel's heroine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.37,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can just tell she's thinking that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:32.45,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Have you had any trouble this past year?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:34.37,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You weren't bullied, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.26,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,By the sea fairies, especially!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:38.72,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Well, they don't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:42.18,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Right?! I knew that was \Nhow it would turn out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:46.02,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,That's why I brought these \Nas your wedding gifts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:47.88,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Earrings?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:49.66,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:52.13,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You've only ever had \Nthe clasping kind before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:54.25,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,So I made these!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:57.44,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,They're protective charms \Nthat I added the Holy Prayer to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:04:59.53,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,These are protective charms?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:02.39,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,One is the pink color of my hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:05.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,and the other is the dark \Nblue of Prince Aqua's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:06.62,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,If you're going to wear something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:09.08,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,it should be the color \Nof the one you love!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:10.96,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,That's why I wear this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:14.96,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Yellow is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:18.09,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Although things are still \Na bit awkward between us...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:22.30,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,But Prince Hartknights \Nhas been so adorable lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:26.31,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,He came along with me, \Nsaying he wanted to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:29.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:30.56,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Since I've received this gift, \NI'd like to put them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:36.14,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,If you want to put them on, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:41.95,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm more surprised to see you \Nbeing so friendly with Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:47.79,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Y-You have a point. \NShe did attack me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:52.38,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,But now we're basically partners \Nin taking down the sequel's heroine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:53.54,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Heroine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:05:58.00,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:06:01.95,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But you were there to save me \Nwhen that happened, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:05.50,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Honestly... You'd better \Ntell me the truth one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:07.48,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:09.15,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's clear to me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:12.21,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,that you've been holding on to \Nsomething you can't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:13.18,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:18.32,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,if you keep me in the dark for too long, \Nbe prepared for the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:24.32,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,It's fine to be all flirty, but do it \Nwhen I'm not around, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:25.78,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:28.31,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Oh, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:30.79,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Just make sure you find happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.35,0:06:32.92,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:50.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Father, Mother, I am truly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.56,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:55.61,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,My father raised me strictly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.61,0:07:00.57,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,and my mother helped me \Nexperience many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:03.57,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,And all of that gives me strength now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:08.57,Default,Schnauss,0,0,0,,Yes. We're so glad to see you this happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.99,0:07:22.59,Default,Iltiana,0,0,0,,The next time we meet will be \Nat your wedding in Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:26.59,Default,Iltiana,0,0,0,,I'm so excited to see you \Nin your bridal attire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.59,0:07:27.79,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:42.42,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's the day I finally \Nbecome Prince Aqua's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.95,0:07:45.36,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,You look beautiful, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:51.07,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you've safely arrived at your \Nwedding day with Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:53.21,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, really now, Philine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:56.33,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What's the use in crying now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.33,0:07:58.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The wedding is tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:02.59,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,You're right. I'm just so excited, \NI couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:08.65,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Who could that be? \NWe weren't expecting anyone, were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:11.01,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,No. I'll go see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.85,0:08:17.74,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm not going to get a visit
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.74,0:08:21.34,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,from Lady Icilla, the heroine, \Nthe day before my wedding, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:26.95,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,It's Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:31.57,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to visit when you're so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:37.33,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Not at all. I'm very happy \Nyou came to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:40.56,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:43.34,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I just had to tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:45.98,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:49.23,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,She didn't come to stop the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:53.85,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I expected her to be in love \Nwith Prince Aqua, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:09:00.10,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Did you, perhaps, think that I had \Nfeelings for Prince Aquasteed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:06.15,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I don't understand love very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:11.40,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I've always believed that my father \Nwould find me a good man to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.90,0:09:13.76,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,She doesn't understand love?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:16.79,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Could that be because I exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:19.65,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Originally, Lady Icilla was supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.65,0:09:24.00,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,nurture her love with Prince Aqua, \None of the conquerable routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:28.97,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,If not for me, they should \Nhave ended up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:33.26,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be right \Nto apologize now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:35.76,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.76,0:09:37.26,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:42.03,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Akari?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.03,0:09:45.44,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Once again, congratulations \Non your marriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:50.05,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you, Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.05,0:09:52.70,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,My name is Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:56.43,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Thank you for greeting me, Lady Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:59.20,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,My name is Icilla Pearllant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:01.34,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,The sequel's heroine...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.34,0:10:03.82,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Yep, just like in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:07.52,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You should be happier. \NYou got to be the heroine, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:08.41,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.05,0:10:13.62,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Akari, please \Ndon't be rude to Lady Icilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:15.16,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:18.61,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Did I upset you? I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:21.73,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,N-No, it didn't bother me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.09,0:10:24.23,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Akari, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.59,0:10:28.52,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I wanted to see the lucky girl \Nwho got to be the sequel's heroine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:31.53,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I mean, life ought to be enjoyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:34.91,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Icilla's the heroine, \Nbut she's not enjoying it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:38.04,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I suppose this is better than losing \NPrince Aqua to her, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:40.74,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You really do love otome games, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:43.75,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,You two seem to be very good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:44.63,Default,Akari/Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:49.69,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Yeah! That's exactly right! \NI'm Lady Tiara's friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:52.26,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,That's why I'm so worried about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:54.06,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:58.76,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Yes! Because you're always \Nhanging around Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:03.27,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You'd better not get too close \Nto my friend's husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:06.87,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Akari, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:10.02,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.34,0:11:14.03,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,It's true. I should have been \Nmore considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:16.74,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please don't say that, Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:19.53,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry \Nabout that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.06,0:11:23.11,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,And Lady Akari, \Nstop saying things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:25.11,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.65,0:11:28.96,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:32.55,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed will be arriving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:34.33,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:36.55,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for staying so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:40.05,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'll take my leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:47.14,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,A dark blue ribbon...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:51.46,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,As expected of the sequel's heroine. \NShe's such a sweet girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:55.64,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Akari, did you come here \Nto say something to Lady Icilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:12:01.16,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Not really. I only came to see \Nhow the sequel ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:04.74,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,How it ends? What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.11,0:12:06.28,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Well, bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:09.33,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Akari?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:20.01,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.14,0:12:42.41,Flashback,Akari FB,0,0,0,,You'd better not get too close \Nto my friend's husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:45.33,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,I never meant to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.23,0:12:51.78,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,I don't have any romantic feelings \Nfor Prince Aquasteed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.30,0:12:54.87,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,His Highness is so brilliant and mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:57.21,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,He's completely out of my reach...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:13.86,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You're sure I don't look strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:18.32,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,You're the most beautiful thing \Nin the world! Be more confident!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:20.03,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:35.52,Flashback Italics,Akari FB,0,0,0,,Not really. I only came to see \Nhow the sequel ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.99,0:13:42.89,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Did she mean some kind of event \Nis going to happen during the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.24,0:13:46.43,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,This is an otome game world, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:49.52,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,There's no way nothing's \Ngoing to happen at a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:51.98,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,It's time for you to make your entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:41.90,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,Why... does my heart hurt so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:47.31,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,It's not as if I was in love \Nwith Prince Aquasteed, so why...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:55.69,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,Did I actually love him after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:59.25,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,Was this feeling I had for him \Nmore than just respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:03.92,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:08.42,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I won't let you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:11.10,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,What was I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.65,0:15:15.14,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla, you really do love \NPrince Aquasteed, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:17.40,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,No... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:21.24,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I would never...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:30.33,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,But... are you telling me \Nthis pain in my chest... is love?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.61,0:15:33.08,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,Yeah, I figured this event would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.90,0:15:40.04,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,The sequel game has an event where the \Nromantic interest marries someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.61,0:15:43.92,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,but the heroine can intervene and stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:45.50,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,The unlock condition
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:49.47,Italics,Akari INT,0,0,0,,is wearing a ribbon in your love \Ninterest's color to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:58.06,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Frankly, I love those \N"intervening in the wedding" events.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:16:00.56,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,They get your heart racing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:04.57,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Because the groom \Nchooses you over his bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:07.45,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,But more than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:12.18,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I can't allow anyone to ruin my friend's \Nwedding when she's smiling so happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.93,0:16:15.54,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,What a coincidence. I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:18.42,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Keith, the Forest Fairy King?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:21.29,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Icilla, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:26.37,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,If you try to do anything \Nto those two, I won't let it slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:29.15,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I-I would never do such a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:31.44,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I will do as you wish, Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:46.94,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,I guess I really can't be by \NPrince Aquasteed's side, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.95,0:16:52.79,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I hear someone crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:17:00.25,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I was right. Lady Icilla \Nreally did love Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:07.98,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:19.53,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I've been so scared about whether \Nthis wedding would actually happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:24.98,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I kept asking what I'd do if Prince Aqua \Nchose Lady Icilla at the last moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:32.24,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But even if I am standing in the way \Nof what should be their true love...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.91,0:17:35.23,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Still, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:39.16,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:43.20,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:50.09,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Losing isn't an option! \NI love Prince Aqua more than anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:54.72,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I want to be with him forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.19,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:18:02.14,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I see I've made you feel uneasy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:12.86,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.02,0:18:23.77,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:27.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you for attending \Nour wedding today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:34.51,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Not at all. Congratulations, \NPrince Aquasteed... Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:43.16,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiararose is the one most precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:49.15,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.97,0:18:52.15,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:57.16,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I did admire you, Prince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:59.82,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,But I've moved past it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.47,0:19:03.23,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Please go on to be happier \Nthan anyone in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:10.95,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,And thank you for teaching me \Nwhat love feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.29,0:19:13.67,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Oh, honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:17.98,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You're so cute when you cry, \NI just want to eat you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.04,0:19:21.68,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Oh, you stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:34.57,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, this ring is filled with my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:36.59,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Will you accept it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:39.73,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Of course, Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:47.60,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,And now, I will hold on to you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:51.64,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I will hold on to you forever, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:53.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:57.76,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:01.94,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:04.70,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'll treasure you for life \Nand make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:07.89,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes. I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.97,0:20:19.58,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It looks like stars raining down...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:21.72,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,To the next king and his queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:25.12,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You have my blessing \Nfor your health and happiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:27.91,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,and for peace in this kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:29.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Keith!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:30.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Fairy King!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:34.23,Default,Attendee1,0,0,0,,The Forest Fairy King \Nblessed them! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:35.92,Default,Attendee2,0,0,0,,What a joyous occasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:51.10,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose! Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:53.12,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:54.77,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.11,0:20:59.12,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Blast it all. Tiara looks so lovely \Nwhen she commands the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.12,0:21:00.53,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,It's troubling how much \Nit makes me want her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:04.27,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,You'll make Prince Aqua \Nangry talking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:21.26,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Are you crying again, Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:23.76,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness. Silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:28.75,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm just so happy and blessed, \Nmy tears won't stop flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.07,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm happy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:35.04,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,And now the game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:39.94,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,From this point on, \NI'll truly live in reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.69,0:21:44.43,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No more living at the mercy of a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:58.39,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Love is worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:39.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&HFC8A3D&\pos(325,123)\blur4\bord1}A {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Love{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Like {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Ripples{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}on the Water
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.01,0:23:39.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&H343E6B&\pos(325,123)\blur1.75\bord1}A {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Love{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Like {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Ripples{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}on the Water
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.73,0:23:33.42,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,My love will never be realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.42,0:23:36.20,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I need to sink it \Ninto the depths of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.64,0:23:39.65,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,But... when I see him smile, I...
